{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aShan Hai Card\u300b is a single-player adventure card game inspired by The Classic of Mountains and Seas. Players assume the role of descendants of the Ancestral Witches, traversing Mount Buzhou, Kunlun Ruins, and Netherworld Guixu with fragments of the Sky-Opening Axe. They build a basic deck at the start of their journey and refine it throughout the adventure to battle against gods corrupted by &quot;HunDun&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/57b819781a2e2603902c28370af5abc5.poster.avif?t=1758779519\" width=1170 height=664 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/57b819781a2e2603902c28370af5abc5.webm?t=1758779519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/57b819781a2e2603902c28370af5abc5.mp4?t=1758779519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, players can choose between the Chaos Faction or the Order Faction, and each faction has a distinct deck-building style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Chaos Faction excels in dealing damage. Its initial skill inflicts 2 points of damage, paired with keywords such as &quot;Assassinate&quot; and &quot;Erode&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Order Faction is skilled at sustain. Its initial skill heals 2 points of health, relying on mechanisms like &quot;Shield&quot; and &quot;Counterattack&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neutral cards break the boundaries of factions, offering rich strategic possibilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are nine key keywords in the game: First Arrival, Soul Breath, Heavenly Secret, Assassinate, Counterattack, Unyielding, Shield, Blood Valor, and Erode.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plans to add more keywords in future updates, including Golden Body, Prying, Paralysis, Armor Penetration, Reconstruction, and more. Stay tuned!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure is divided into five chapters, and players will face 10 to 15 types of Bosses during their adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Players will encounter various events throughout their adventure, and each event will have an impact on the player's health, deck composition, mana, hand cards, and more.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/1ea937dfe0d9e74dbf00126c5df6a4c7.poster.avif?t=1758779519\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/1ea937dfe0d9e74dbf00126c5df6a4c7.webm?t=1758779519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/1ea937dfe0d9e74dbf00126c5df6a4c7.mp4?t=1758779519\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/fc083e266e16b4d33ea5fa3a620f0252.poster.avif?t=1758779519\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3958940/extras/fc083e266e16b4d33ea5fa3a620f0252.webm?t=1758779519\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story choices shape the ending\u2014will you uphold order or embrace chaos? Weave your own Great Wilderness legend with cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar